{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/9e115eb4e3464fda97a8ea757384b95b/snapshots/d4b2e70aa658458c8e01a3e9019b381a-00004.jpg\"/><p>華山是中國五嶽之一，在中國歷史、文化及神話中佔有特殊地位。不少遊客前往陝西渭南，都為了欣賞這座名山展現的自然美景。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"(已改標題)8502302_華山奇險引客 五嶽之巔花崗奇觀_1126 - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/9e115eb4e3464fda97a8ea757384b95b/snapshots/d4b2e70aa658458c8e01a3e9019b381a-00006.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>花崗岩地貌獨特　文化地位特殊</strong></p><p></p><p>華山由一整塊花崗岩形成，岩性單一，屬罕見自然奇觀。華山以險峻懸崖聞名，通往山頂的蜿蜒山路全長12公里，山頂海拔2154.9米，為中國五嶽中最高峰。遊客前來既可感受大自然的鬼斧神工，亦可領略華山承載的深厚歷史文化底蘊。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"(已改標題)8502302_華山奇險引客 五嶽之巔花崗奇觀_1126 - 截图5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/9e115eb4e3464fda97a8ea757384b95b/snapshots/d4b2e70aa658458c8e01a3e9019b381a-00005.jpg\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:43:57.328332+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:37:21.308687+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T00:37:18.535969+00:00","content_hash":"8de6b97f2be86d8ba3090916afdf8539341dc96a7b1ed5e51ba8f514b52e84a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:43:57.328332+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}